md"""
# Proof of Lemma 2.13
This notebook contains the computer-assisted part of the proof of Lemma 2.13.
"""

# ╔═╡ 862a900f-4179-41d7-b4fc-95517effcf76
md"""
## Goal
We want to prove that

$$|a_0| \leq C_{a_0},$$

where

$$a_0 = \frac{c_N}{\lambda^{1/2}J_1(\lambda^{1/2})}$$

and $C_{a_0}$ is given by:
"""

# ╔═╡ ec700cd2-d9a1-4c70-ad14-786fa42b33dd
C_a_0 = SRP.C_a_0

# ╔═╡ 311e1925-2f21-4bf2-82d8-3fb55875d968
md"""
## Proof
From the same lemma in the paper we have that $|c_N| \leq 1$, hence

$$|a_0| \leq \frac{1}{\lambda^{1/2}J_1(\lambda^{1/2})},$$

where we can enclose the left hand side directly:
"""

# ╔═╡ de88b6f6-1e1d-40ec-aefa-65c4a6fa43ed
λ = SRP.λ_disc()

# ╔═╡ abc2f9f9-a622-4d50-85d9-2ffb5fc379b8
a_0_bound = 1 / (sqrt(λ) * besselj1(sqrt(λ)))

# ╔═╡ d008caab-a6e9-4d57-902b-1d305bb4d030
md"""
Finally, we verify that the required bound holds:
"""

# ╔═╡ 876cbdd3-b42f-4962-bb1d-137cbd2d0f0e
a_0_bound <= Arb(C_a_0)

